WARNING: Running Bazel server needs to be killed, because the following startup options are different:
  - Only in old server: -Dbazel.windows_unix_root=E:/scw/msys64/usr/bin/bash.exe --host_jvm_args=-Dbazel.windows_unix_root=E:/scw/msys64/usr/bin/bash.exe
  - Only in new server: -Dbazel.windows_unix_root=C:\WINDOWS\system32\bash.exe --host_jvm_args=-Dbazel.windows_unix_root=C:\WINDOWS\system32\bash.exe
